<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100094" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξ-αίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assist in raising</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θάλατταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.5.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>raise together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὄγκον τοὺς μῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.296
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be raised together</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ διαφράγματι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				173
			</span></i>; <i>to be swollen at the same time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(2).268
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξαρθεὶς ὑπό τινων</span>
			<i>being lifted up by the joint effort of . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν ἠχώ</span>
			<i>help in calling forth</i> the echo, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. θρῆνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὴν φιλοτιμίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.819f
				</span></i>
			; <i>help to excite</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dom.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξαρθεὶς τοῖς λόγοις</span>
			<i>excited with the rest</i> by . . , <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>rise together</i>, of the sea, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.3.5
			</span></i>; <i>go out along with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.2.35
			</span></i>; of colonists, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.5.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>remove as well</i>, in dissection, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.699
			</span></i>.</div>
